{"summary":"Jump, roll, and slide your way through exciting obstacles and enemies forever.","description":"Which Color are you? What about NOW? Get ready for Color Switch an addictive and visually stunning gaming experience with Color Switch! This mobile game challenges you to navigate through obstacles by matching your character's color with the color of the obstacles. \n\nThe Perfect Game to Test Your Perseverance\n\nColor Switch is a challenging and addictive game that will test your reflexes and problem-solving skills. In this game, you must navigate your character through a series of obstacles by matching your character's color with the color of the obstacles. It sounds easy, but it's harder than it looks!\n\nWith over 3,500 levels to play, Color Switch will keep you entertained for hours on end.\n\nAs you progress through the game, the obstacles will become more challenging, and you'll need to use all your skills to keep your character alive. But don't worry, if you fail, you can always try again!\n\nThe game's vibrant colors and smooth animations will make you feel like you're inside a living painting. And the catchy music will keep you entertained as you play.\n\nWhether you're a casual gamer or a hardcore completionist, Color Switch is the perfect game for you.\n\nIt's easy to pick up and play, but it's also challenging enough to keep you entertained for hours on end. So what are you waiting for? Download Color Switch today and see how far you can go!\n\nAre you up for a challenge?","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $9.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BqkrFxF8IMs?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PmGVbA_wu7q5sIaPbBuQo5pgDBP3XaHFeIMOR4BbCTboIfT7me204nwi-RuMqitWyRKZkykB6qklU9lFuyBZwg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l3NmTGStxlFVclA5lIgK_OBFZsMFIeugAkYiOwX7AD7Hng-IJ--d1Ok3JTsDSxpxsyu8T0TAXgybtjUKPFTC","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wo_Kei0V